摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"The world's first open-source AI-native vector design tool and the first to feature concurrent Agent Teams. Design-as-Code. Turn prompts into UI directly on the live canvas. A modern alternative to Pencil.","id":"gh:1159938129","install_available":false,"language":"Rust","name":"openpencil","slug":"ZSeven-W/openpencil","topics":["agent","agent-team","ai","claude","claude-code","codex","dsh-plugin","fimga","flutter","mcp","opencode","openpencil","pencil","react","react-native","rust","skill","ui","vibecoding","vibedesign"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"The world's first open-source AI-native vector design tool and the first to feature concurrent Agent"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" Teams. Design-as-Code. Turn prompts into UI directly on the live canvas. A modern alternative to Pe"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"s. Design-as-Code. Turn prompts into UI directly on the live canvas. A modern alternative to Pencil."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"OpenPencil"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"The world's first open-source AI-native vector design tool."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Concurrent Agent Teams • Design-as-Code • Built-in MCP Server • Multi-model Intelligence"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English · 简体中文 · 繁體中文 · 日本語 · 한국어 · Français · Español · Deutsch · Português · Русский · हिन्दी · Tü"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"rkçe · ไทย · Tiếng Việt · Bahasa Indonesia"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Click the image to watch the demo video"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Why OpenPencil"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### 🎨 Prompt → Canvas"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Describe any UI in natural language. Watch it appear on the infinite canvas in real-time with stream"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ing animation. Modify existing designs by selecting elements and chatting."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 🤖 Concurrent Agent Teams"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The orchestrator decomposes complex pages into spatial sub-tasks. Multiple AI agents work on differe"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"nt sections simultaneously — hero, features, footer — all streaming in parallel with per-member canv"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"multaneously — hero, features, footer — all streaming in parallel with per-member canvas indicators."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 🧠 Multi-Model Intelligence"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Automatically adapts to each model's capabilities. Claude gets full prompts with thinking; GPT-4o/Ge"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"mini disable thinking; smaller models (MiniMax, Qwen, Llama) get simplified prompts for reliable out"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" disable thinking; smaller models (MiniMax, Qwen, Llama) get simplified prompts for reliable output."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 🔌 MCP Server"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"One-click install into Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, Kiro, or Copilot CLIs. Design from your termina"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"l — read, create, and modify `.op` files through any MCP-compatible agent."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**Canvas & Drawing**"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Infinite canvas with pan, zoom, smart alignment guides, and snapping\n- Rectangle, Ellipse, Line, P"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"olygon, Pen (Bezier), Frame, Text\n- Boolean operations — union, subtract, intersect with contextual "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"toolbar\n- Icon picker (Iconify) and image import (PNG/JPEG/SVG/WebP/GIF)\n- Auto-layout — vertical/ho"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"rizontal with gap, padding, justify, align\n- Multi-page documents with tab navigation"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Design System**"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- Design variables — color, number, string tokens with `$variable` references\n- Multi-theme support "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"— multiple axes, each with variants (Light/Dark, Compact/Comfortable)\n- Component system — reusable "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"components with instances and overrides\n- CSS sync — auto-generated custom properties, `var(--name)`"},{"id":"p20s4","text":" in code output\n- Reusable UIKits — import/export component kits from `.pen` files"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**AI & Agents**"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- Prompt-to-canvas with streaming generation and orchestrator-driven spatial decomposition\n- Concurr"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ent Agent Teams — multiple designers work on different sections in parallel with per-member canvas i"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ndicators\n- Layered workflow — `design_skeleton` → `design_content` → `design_refine` with focused p"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"rompts per phase\n- Style Guides — 50+ built-in styles (glassmorphism, brutalist, retro, etc.) with t"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"ag-based fuzzy matching, wired into planning and generation\n- Multi-model capability profiles — auto"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"-adapts thinking mode, effort, and prompt shape per model tier\n- Built-in Rust agent runtime + Anthr"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"opic, Claude Agent SDK, OpenCode, Codex, Copilot, Google Gemini API providers\n- Anthropic-format pas"},{"id":"p22s8","text":"sthrough for Chinese LLM providers — Kimi, Zhipu, GLM, DouBao, Ark, Bailian/DashScope, ModelScope, C"},{"id":"p22s9","text":"r Chinese LLM providers — Kimi, Zhipu, GLM, DouBao, Ark, Bailian/DashScope, ModelScope, Coding Plans"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**Collaboration**"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- Authenticated peer-to-peer sessions with a public relay fallback and built-in regional collaborati"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"on hubs\n- Join with a 10-character region-tagged pairing code — no account required for LAN sessions"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"\n- Live remote cursors, cross-account collaboration, and a conflict panel with per-edit detail and r"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"eplay of discarded edits\n- Online multi-tenant mode for the `--serve-web` daemon, authenticated agai"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"nst the op-hub with cross-account tenant sharing\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Why Rust"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"OpenPencil was rewritten from the ground up in **Rust** (#129). The rewrite is complete — the TypeSc"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ript + Electron editor was retired at `v0.7.5`, and the Rust workspace in this repo is the product: "},{"id":"p26s3","text":"one native core that is dramatically smaller and faster, and runs on more platforms from a single co"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"ive core that is dramatically smaller and faster, and runs on more platforms from a single codebase."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"|                       | TypeScript + Electron (retired, `v0.7.5`)      | Rust (today)             "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"                                           |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| **Desktop runtime**   | Electron — bundles Chromium + Node.js          | Native window (`winit` + "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"GPU Skia), no browser engine               |\n| **Desktop footprint** | Full Chromium runtime per ins"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"tall              | Single self-contained binary — **55.5 MB**                          |\n| **Web pa"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"yload**       | JS + WASM bundle                               | **8.2 MB** wasm / **2.18 MB** gzip "},{"id":"p28s5","text":"over the wire                    |\n| **Rendering**         | CanvasKit/Skia on web                  "},{"id":"p28s6","text":"        | One GPU-accelerated Skia backend on **every** target                |\n| **Memory**        "},{"id":"p28s7","text":"    | JavaScript GC pauses                           | No GC — Rust ownership, predictable latency  "},{"id":"p28s8","text":"                       |\n| **Codebase**          | Web stack + Electron                           | "},{"id":"p28s9","text":"One Rust workspace: editor · CLI · MCP · AI · codegen · Figma · Git  |\n| **Targets**           | Web"},{"id":"p28s10","text":" + desktop, two separate stacks             | Desktop (macOS/Win/Linux) · mobile (iOS/Android) · bro"},{"id":"p28s11","text":"eparate stacks             | Desktop (macOS/Win/Linux) · mobile (iOS/Android) · browser — one core |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"**Measured improvements**"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- **Tiny footprint** — the whole desktop app is one **55.5 MB** native binary instead of a bundled b"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"rowser engine plus a Node runtime. The web build is **8.2 MB** raw / **2.18 MB** gzip after splittin"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"g the icon catalog (−48% over the wire).\n- **Scales to large documents** — a **10,000-node** live ca"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"nvas (nested auto-layout, four levels deep) writes, reads, and snapshots layout with **no panics and"},{"id":"p30s5","text":" ~0% idle CPU**; a full layout snapshot of all 10k nodes returns in **~0.68 s**.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
